<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/uvekhen_tzaddikim"><tei:pb n="658" ed="1949 rosh hashana and erev yom kippur" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n682_medium.jpg"/><tei:p>May the righteous men see this and rejoice, the upright exult, and the godly thrill with delight. Iniquity shall shut its mouth, wickedness shall vanish like smoke, when thou wilt abolish the rule of tyranny on earth.</tei:p></tei:div>
